{"logId": "cc154e8c-5aa7-4dfa-a079-c8109a3d5c3e", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "doc_title", "block_content": "小偷的信任", "block_bbox": [239, 226, 506, 283], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 226.0], [506.0, 226.0], [506.0, 283.0], [239.0, 283.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "作者：服饰部/姜凤婷", "block_bbox": [346, 292, 506, 315], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[346.0, 292.0], [506.0, 292.0], [506.0, 315.0], [346.0, 315.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "去年10月的一天晚上，在东区2号收银台，梦特娇皮具专柜的营业员将一个皮包交到收银台，说有可能是顾客遗失的。大家打开包一看，里面一分现金没有，但失主的身份证、医疗卡、电话本等重要物品却放在里面，原来是小偷偷的包。怎么办呢？如果告诉失主，她又会怎么想呢？我们真有些为难。\n这时止好我们的王管秋姐来了，听元情况后，她用自己的手机按电话本上的号码一个一个打，但很多都说不认识失主，后来有一个号码，是失主家里的，秋姐便向他说明了情况。第二天一早，一位中年大姐便来到收银台问包，在核对无误后，收银员将包还给了她。失主激动地说：“我的包是在批发市场丢的啊，小偷还真聪明，也算有良心，把包丢在胖东来，看来胖东来就是值得信任！”听完这些话我的内心不知道该是高兴还是难受，我希望这个世界多些关爱，多些正义，多些和谐那该多好啊！", "block_bbox": [238, 371, 788, 522], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 371.0], [788.0, 371.0], [788.0, 522.0], [238.0, 522.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [237, 526, 799, 710], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[237.0, 535.0], [798.0, 535.0], [798.0, 709.0], [237.0, 709.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [239, 715, 790, 772], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 715.0], [790.0, 715.0], [790.0, 772.0], [239.0, 772.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [73, 604, 225, 726], "block_id": 5, "block_order": null, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[73.0, 604.0], [225.0, 604.0], [225.0, 726.0], [73.0, 726.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [786, 373, 1012, 727], "block_id": 6, "block_order": null, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[786.0, 373.0], [1012.0, 373.0], [1012.0, 727.0], [786.0, 727.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "心灵销售", "block_bbox": [241, 794, 453, 847], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[241.0, 794.0], [453.0, 794.0], [453.0, 847.0], [241.0, 847.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "作者：广场营销部/苗晓娟", "block_bbox": [260, 855, 452, 877], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[260.0, 855.0], [451.0, 855.0], [451.0, 876.0], [260.0, 876.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "前一段时间，我们区来了一对父子。男孩个子瘦高，十七八岁的样子，穿得很讲究，而他的父亲穿的很朴素，衣服和裤子还有一些破。", "block_bbox": [239, 904, 1013, 961], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 904.0], [1013.0, 904.0], [1013.0, 961.0], [239.0, 961.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "我介绍的款式男孩相不中，他父亲挑的也相不中，最后他相中了一款218元的夹克，他的父亲很尴尬，从兜里掏出了160元钱，说就拿了280元钱，刚买了一条裤子120元。他对儿子说：“娃，要不咱再挑个吧！”儿子坚持说：“不，别的不要。”然后就扭头站在了一边。", "block_bbox": [238, 967, 1014, 1055], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 967.0], [1014.0, 967.0], [1014.0, 1055.0], [238.0, 1055.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "从父亲的话中，我了解到他们家就这一个独子，要什么给什么，从来没有说过不，脾气还很大。", "block_bbox": [239, 1061, 1014, 1117], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 1061.0], [1014.0, 1061.0], [1014.0, 1117.0], [239.0, 1117.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "我就过去和他聊，聊我的爸爸，如何的坚决让我独立，我的眼泪和辛酸，与他的父亲对他有多好来比较。他的眼神变了，自己找了一款和原先款式相似价格148元的上衣，试穿后很高兴的接受了。", "block_bbox": [238, 1123, 1015, 1212], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 1123.0], [1015.0, 1123.0], [1015.0, 1212.0], [238.0, 1212.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "我想他父亲会很高兴儿子的变化，更会满意我们的服务。", "block_bbox": [280, 1217, 735, 1243], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[280.0, 1217.0], [735.0, 1217.0], [735.0, 1243.0], [280.0, 1243.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "由小事想到的", "block_bbox": [113, 1404, 330, 1447], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[113.0, 1404.0], [330.0, 1404.0], [330.0, 1447.0], [113.0, 1447.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 6, "label": "doc_title", "score": 0.6073260307312012, "coordinate": [239, 226, 506, 283], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 226.0], [506.0, 226.0], [506.0, 283.0], [239.0, 283.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7663059830665588, "coordinate": [346, 292, 506, 315], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[346.0, 292.0], [506.0, 292.0], [506.0, 315.0], [346.0, 315.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9362553358078003, "coordinate": [238, 371, 788, 522], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 371.0], [788.0, 371.0], [788.0, 522.0], [238.0, 522.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.431144654750824, "coordinate": [73, 604, 225, 726], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[73.0, 604.0], [225.0, 604.0], [225.0, 726.0], [73.0, 726.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9158747792243958, "coordinate": [237, 526, 799, 710], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[237.0, 535.0], [798.0, 535.0], [798.0, 709.0], [237.0, 709.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9031305313110352, "coordinate": [786, 373, 1012, 727], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[786.0, 373.0], [1012.0, 373.0], [1012.0, 727.0], [786.0, 727.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8762580752372742, "coordinate": [239, 715, 790, 772], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 715.0], [790.0, 715.0], [790.0, 772.0], [239.0, 772.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.5351842045783997, "coordinate": [241, 794, 453, 847], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[241.0, 794.0], [453.0, 794.0], [453.0, 847.0], [241.0, 847.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7608934044837952, "coordinate": [260, 855, 452, 877], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[260.0, 855.0], [451.0, 855.0], [451.0, 876.0], [260.0, 876.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.908994734287262, "coordinate": [239, 904, 1013, 961], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 904.0], [1013.0, 904.0], [1013.0, 961.0], [239.0, 961.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9272859692573547, "coordinate": [238, 967, 1014, 1055], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 967.0], [1014.0, 967.0], [1014.0, 1055.0], [238.0, 1055.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9098085761070251, "coordinate": [239, 1061, 1014, 1117], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 1061.0], [1014.0, 1061.0], [1014.0, 1117.0], [239.0, 1117.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.932770848274231, "coordinate": [238, 1123, 1015, 1212], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 1123.0], [1015.0, 1123.0], [1015.0, 1212.0], [238.0, 1212.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8206326365470886, "coordinate": [280, 1217, 735, 1243], "order": 12, "polygon_points": [[280.0, 1217.0], [735.0, 1217.0], [735.0, 1243.0], [280.0, 1243.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.5044405460357666, "coordinate": [113, 1404, 330, 1447], "order": 13, "polygon_points": [[113.0, 1404.0], [330.0, 1404.0], [330.0, 1447.0], [113.0, 1447.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "# 小偷的信任\n\n作者：服饰部/姜凤婷\n\n去年10月的一天晚上，在东区2号收银台，梦特娇皮具专柜的营业员将一个皮包交到收银台，说有可能是顾客遗失的。大家打开包一看，里面一分现金没有，但失主的身份证、医疗卡、电话本等重要物品却放在里面，原来是小偷偷的包。怎么办呢？如果告诉失主，她又会怎么想呢？我们真有些为难。\n\n这时止好我们的王管秋姐来了，听元情况后，她用自己的手机按电话本上的号码一个一个打，但很多都说不认识失主，后来有一个号码，是失主家里的，秋姐便向他说明了情况。第二天一早，一位中年大姐便来到收银台问包，在核对无误后，收银员将包还给了她。失主激动地说：“我的包是在批发市场丢的啊，小偷还真聪明，也算有良心，把包丢在胖东来，看来胖东来就是值得信任！”听完这些话我的内心不知道该是高兴还是难受，我希望这个世界多些关爱，多些正义，多些和谐那该多好啊！\n\n\n\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_73_604_225_726.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"12%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_786_373_1012_727.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"18%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 心灵销售\n\n作者：广场营销部/苗晓娟\n\n前一段时间，我们区来了一对父子。男孩个子瘦高，十七八岁的样子，穿得很讲究，而他的父亲穿的很朴素，衣服和裤子还有一些破。\n\n我介绍的款式男孩相不中，他父亲挑的也相不中，最后他相中了一款218元的夹克，他的父亲很尴尬，从兜里掏出了160元钱，说就拿了280元钱，刚买了一条裤子120元。他对儿子说：“娃，要不咱再挑个吧！”儿子坚持说：“不，别的不要。”然后就扭头站在了一边。\n\n从父亲的话中，我了解到他们家就这一个独子，要什么给什么，从来没有说过不，脾气还很大。\n\n我就过去和他聊，聊我的爸爸，如何的坚决让我独立，我的眼泪和辛酸，与他的父亲对他有多好来比较。他的眼神变了，自己找了一款和原先款式相似价格148元的上衣，试穿后很高兴的接受了。\n\n我想他父亲会很高兴儿子的变化，更会满意我们的服务。\n\n## 由小事想到的", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_73_604_225_726.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//cc154e8c-5aa7-4dfa-a079-c8109a3d5c3e/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_73_604_225_726.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A14%3A34Z%2F-1%2F%2F05ba1fbd39545a36d869af277094756acd2672a35e1bfb8e921a951f5d1b20d3", "imgs/img_in_image_box_786_373_1012_727.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//cc154e8c-5aa7-4dfa-a079-c8109a3d5c3e/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_786_373_1012_727.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A14%3A34Z%2F-1%2F%2Ff5876b9d3e6aedc6bf4c8b5e7b9ddc71a4b88440ae71ae01a703dad9608f4745"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//cc154e8c-5aa7-4dfa-a079-c8109a3d5c3e/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A14%3A34Z%2F-1%2F%2F4327be7585ed33fc00a02b435ce70960ca4c08bc7b6904b3e547b3492708d206"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//cc154e8c-5aa7-4dfa-a079-c8109a3d5c3e/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A14%3A34Z%2F-1%2F%2Fc3444e703db4278b373a1606496e99dd5d406ca008680bb0d9019b3ed3c2dad9"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//cc154e8c-5aa7-4dfa-a079-c8109a3d5c3e/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A14%3A35Z%2F-1%2F%2Fe25a85fe145988d36e96a466370c4a36465f51baf1ec03989f35e40d262f02b5"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
